  "_comment": [
    "T3.11.07 — postal and courier services that can carry a parcel onward",
    "INSIDE the destination country, after the carrier has landed in the hub",
    "city. This is the 44.9 % of the market that writes «отправлю СДЭК» or",
    "«will post it on USPS».",
    "",
    "What is deliberately NOT here: marketplace pickup (Ozon, Wildberries,",
    "Amazon). Collecting an order by its number is a purchase-and-collect",
    "errand, not onward shipping — it already has its own service key,",
    "`marketplace_pickup`. Listing them here would put the same thing in two",
    "vocabularies and let a carrier answer one question twice.",
    "",
    "`global` are the couriers that operate across borders everywhere and are",
    "offered for every country. `countries` adds the national operator and the",
    "domestic carriers people actually name. Order within a list is the order",
    "shown: national post first where it is the common answer, otherwise the",
    "carrier the market names most.",
    "",
    "Not exhaustive and not pretending to be. The form keeps free text, so a",
    "service missing here costs a carrier nothing; adding one is a line in this",
    "file and no migration."
  ],
